        "created_at": "2013-04-18T14:23:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the Gameplay section of the rules, for the Requisition phase, it says:</p><ul><li>Requisition: Players may purchase cards from the Station in their sector</li></ul><p>But in the actual Requisition section of the rules, it just says \"Then, each player may purchase cards equal to this value.\" &nbsp;No mention of the fact that the card being purchased must be from the sector that player is currently in. &nbsp;If it's easy to do, it seems like this important limitation should probably be mentioned in the Requisition section of the rules, since it'd be easy to overlook otherwise.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:05.466Z",
